# Egypt Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to Egypt's governance ecosystem.

The framework illustrates how governance, procurement, public finance, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), institutional memory, coordination, and AI governance interact to transform investment into sustained national capability.

This document is an illustrative institutional reference architecture.

---

# National Context

Country: Arab Republic of Egypt

Population: ~115 million

Government System: Presidential Republic

Administrative Structure

- Central Government
- Governorates
- Districts
- Cities
- Villages

